DuoDuo Pocket firmware for the FoloToy AI Passport
====================================================

This repository is a fork of FoloToy AI Passport (https://github.com/folotoy/ai-passport)
and carries code under two licences and font data under a third. The DuoDuo names and the
screen mockups are brand assets with no open licence.

