Brand assets
------------

The DuoDuo and OpenDuo names (trademarks) and the pocket screen mockups are openduo brand
assets. Neither MIT nor FSL-1.1-Apache-2.0 covers them, and no other licence is granted. A fork
or derived product must replace them (the mockups, the device name "DuoDuo Pocket" and the
多多 / 多多随身 names in main/pocket_strings.h) before distribution. The avatar images follow
the code licence, FSL-1.1-Apache-2.0.
FoloToy names, logos and marks remain FoloToy's.
